sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as Chat UI (React)
    participant CF as CloudFront + edge function
    participant AG as Agent (Lambda, LangGraph)
    participant CH as Chats (DynamoDB)
    participant LLM as OpenAI
    participant MCP as MCP server (Lambda)
    participant API as Blog API (Lambda)
    participant LS as LangSmith

    User->>UI: "Which posts are published?"
    UI->>CF: POST /api/agent/chat {message, conversation_id}
    CF->>AG: POST /chat (response streaming)
    AG-->>UI: SSE conversation {id}
    AG->>CH: GetItem thread_id
    CH-->>AG: earlier messages (none yet)

    Note over AG,MCP: One MCP session per turn
    AG->>MCP: POST /mcp initialize
    MCP-->>AG: server info + capabilities
    AG->>MCP: POST /mcp tools/list
    MCP-->>AG: 8 tools with JSON Schemas
    AG-->>UI: SSE mcp_connected {tools}

    Note over AG,LLM: LangGraph "agent" node
    AG->>LLM: messages + tools as OpenAI functions (streaming)
    LLM-->>AG: tool_call list_posts {status: "published"}
    AG-->>UI: SSE tool_call list_posts

    Note over AG,API: LangGraph "tools" node
    AG->>MCP: POST /mcp tools/call list_posts
    MCP->>API: GET /posts?status=published
    API-->>MCP: 200 [posts]
    MCP-->>AG: result (structuredContent)
    AG-->>UI: SSE tool_result list_posts

    Note over AG,LLM: back to the "agent" node
    AG->>LLM: messages + tool result (streaming)
    loop every generated token
        LLM-->>AG: token
        AG-->>UI: SSE token {text}
    end
    LLM-->>AG: done, no more tool calls (route to END)

    AG->>CH: PutItem thread_id {messages, expires_at = now + 7 days}
    AG->>LS: flush traces (agent, ChatOpenAI, mcp tools/call spans)
    AG-->>UI: SSE done
    UI-->>User: Rendered Markdown answer
